One control library, mapped across every framework you answer to.
01
One scan covers every regulator. Each finding is mapped across all of your active frameworks at once, so a single fix earns credit wherever the control overlaps.
02
Findings are ranked by the licence risk they carry, so your team fixes what your regulator cares about first.
03
Most scanner output never blocks an audit. CyberPlug filters it down to the handful of findings that do, and your team spends its time fixing instead of triaging.
04
CyberPlug pulls fresh evidence from your systems on a schedule and keeps each item linked to the controls it satisfies, ready to hand to any auditor.
05
Controls are re-checked around the clock. Drift and expirations are caught long before your next audit window.
06
Export a formatted audit package for each active framework, scoped to exactly what that inspector needs to see.
