--- Page: https://cyberplug.cc/about ---
About CyberPlug
Platform
How it works
About
Book a demo
CyberPlug connects to your stack and maps your security controls to every framework your regulators expect, both local and international. You map your controls once and stay aligned across ISO 27001, ISO 42001, PCI-DSS, GDPR, NIST CSF and more, instead of rebuilding evidence from scratch for every audit.
By the time an audit lands, your evidence is already gathered and up to date. We are a team of engineers, operators and compliance specialists who want to make trust automatic, so regulated teams can move fast without losing the paper trail.
A small, focused leadership team spanning product, business, engineering and AI.
Team Lead
Business Lead
Tech Lead
AI Lead
The basics on what CyberPlug does and how to get going.
CyberPlug connects to the tools you already use and maps your security controls to the frameworks you answer to. Instead of chasing screenshots and spreadsheets before every audit, you get one live picture of where you stand and what still needs work.
We map your controls across ISO 27001, ISO 42001, PCI-DSS, GDPR, NIST CSF and SOC 2, alongside the local regulations your business is held to. Map a control once and it counts everywhere it applies.
CyberPlug plugs into your cloud, identity and security tools through read-only integrations. It pulls the evidence it needs in the background, so your team keeps working the way it already does.
Most teams are connected and seeing their first control coverage within days, not months. You start with the frameworks that matter most and expand from there at your own pace.
Security is the product, so we hold ourselves to the same bar we help you reach. Integrations are scoped to read-only access, data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and we only collect what is needed to assess your controls.
Book a demo and we will walk you through how CyberPlug fits your stack and your frameworks. You can also reach us any time at
[email protected]
.
Questions, partnerships, or support: reach our team at one address and we will point it to the right person.
[email protected]
